| [[File:Reflections-Foil-L-Redemption-PSA-photo-138963766-original.jpg|200px|link=Redemption (Reflections Foil)|alt=Redemption, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Redemption (Reflections Foil)|Redemption]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Capital|Capital]] || VR || 1 || May add 4 pilots and 4 passengers. Has ship-docking capability. Permanent pilot provides ability of 1. Your medical droids and Bacta Tank ‘patients’ may deploy aboard for free.
