| <div style="position:relative;width:200px;height:119px;"><div style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:200px;transform:translateY(119px) rotate(-90deg) scale(0.59033333);transform-origin:0 0;">[[File:Reflections-Foil-L-Rendezvous-Point-PSA-photo-135731681-original.jpg|200px|link=Rendezvous Point (Reflections Foil)|alt=Rendezvous Point, Reflections foil, English]]</div></div> || [[Rendezvous Point (Reflections Foil)|Rendezvous Point]] || English || [[Location]] — [[System|System]] || VR ||  || '''Light Side:''' Your starships deploy −2 here and are hyperspeed +2 when moving to or from here. Opponent’s Force drains here are canceled. You may not Force drain here.<br />'''Dark Side:'''
