| [[File:Reflections-Foil-L-Uncontrollable-Fury-PSA-photo-148010653-original.jpg|200px|link=Uncontrollable Fury (Reflections Foil)|alt=Uncontrollable Fury, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Uncontrollable Fury (Reflections Foil)|Uncontrollable Fury]] || English || [[Effect]] || VR || 2 || Deploy on Vader. He is power +2, but neither adds 1 to battle destiny nor allows Tarkin to cancel destiny. Opponent loses 2 Force at end of each of opponent’s turns in which Vader did not battle and you had a character of ability &gt; 3 on table. (Immune to Alter.)
