| [[File:Reflections-Foil-L-Wedge-Antilles-PSA-photo-138963762-original.jpg|200px|link=Wedge Antilles (Reflections Foil)|alt=Wedge Antilles, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Wedge Antilles (Reflections Foil)|Wedge Antilles]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Rebel|Rebel]] || VR || 4 || Adds 3 to power of anything he pilots. When piloting Red 2, also adds 2 to maneuver and draws one battle destiny if not able to otherwise. May use 1 Force to take one Corellian Slip into hand from Reserve Deck; reshuffle.
