| [[File:Reflections-Foil-L-What-Is-Thy-Bidding-My-Master-PSA-photo-144332886-original.jpg|200px|link=What Is Thy Bidding, My Master? (Reflections Foil)|alt=What Is Thy Bidding, My Master?, Reflections foil, English]] || [[What Is Thy Bidding, My Master? (Reflections Foil)|What Is Thy Bidding, My Master?]] || English || [[Effect]] — [[Utinni Effect|Utinni Effect]] || VR || 3 || Deploy on Emperor Palpatine or any system. Target one character whose lore uses the word ‘Emperor.’ Target cannot use ability to draw battle destiny and is excluded from being the “highest-ability character.” Utinni Effect canceled when reached by target.
