| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Bossk-PSA-photo-155135600-original.jpg|200px|link=Bossk (Reflections Foil)|alt=Bossk, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Bossk (Reflections Foil)|Bossk]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 1 || Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. When piloting ''Hound’s Tooth'', draws one battle destiny if not able to otherwise. Adds 1 to attrition against opponent in battles at same site. May reduce Chewie’s forfeit to zero while present.
