| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Bossk-In-Hound-s-Tooth-PSA-photo-146715529-original.jpg|200px|link=Bossk In Hound's Tooth (Reflections Foil)|alt=Bossk In Hound's Tooth, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Bossk In Hound's Tooth (Reflections Foil)|Bossk In Hound's Tooth]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Capital Starship|Capital Starship]] || VR || 1 || May add 6 passengers and 1 vehicle. Permanent pilot is •Bossk, who provides ability of 2, adds 2 to power and adds one battle destiny. Deploys and moves like a starfighter. Has ship-docking capability.
