| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Dengar-PSA-photo-155139320-original.jpg|200px|link=Dengar (Reflections Foil)|alt=Dengar, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Dengar (Reflections Foil)|Dengar]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 1 || Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. Power +1 for every opponent’s character present. May reduce Han’s forfeit to zero while present.
