| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Epic-Duel-PSA-photo-146864333-original.jpg|200px|link=Epic Duel (Reflections Foil)|alt=Epic Duel, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Epic Duel (Reflections Foil)|Epic Duel]] || English || [[Epic Event]] || VR || 0 || Deploy on your side of table. The Circle Is Now Complete or Vader’s Obsession may be played to initiate an epic duel as follows: If Vader is present with specified target, each player draws two destiny (add 1 to each destiny draw if using a lightsaber). Add character’s ability. If Vader loses, place him out of play. You lose 6 Force (9 if dueling Luke). If Obi-Wan loses, place him out of play. Opponent loses 9 Force. If Luke loses, opponent must choose: Cross Luke to the Dark Side and lose X Force, where X = Luke’s ability. OR Lose Luke and lose triple X Force.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Expand-The-Empire-PSA-photo-140931626-original.jpg|200px|link=Expand The Empire (Reflections Foil)|alt=Expand The Empire, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Expand The Empire (Reflections Foil)|Expand The Empire]] || English || [[Effect]] || VR || 3 || Deploy on any site. ‘Expands’ your “game text” for that site to add to your “game text” at the adjacent sites.
