| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Greedo-PSA-photo-148512023-original.jpg|200px|link=Greedo (Reflections Foil)|alt=Greedo, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Greedo (Reflections Foil)|Greedo]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 2 || During opponent’s control phase, may ‘threaten’ one smuggler at same site. Opponent may use all Force Pile cards to cancel threat, allowing you to activate same amount. Otherwise, draw destiny. If destiny + Greedo’s ability &gt; 6, smuggler lost.
