| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-IG-88-PSA-photo-155135606-original.jpg|200px|link=IG-88 (Reflections Foil)|alt=IG-88, Reflections foil, English]] || [[IG-88 (Reflections Foil)|IG-88]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Droid|Droid]] || VR || 1 || Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. May ‘assassinate’ any character at same site ‘hit’ by IG-88 (victim is immediately lost). May use two different weapons. May initiate battle and be battled. Immune to Restraining Bolt and purchase.
