| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-IT-O-Eyetee-Oh-PSA-photo-165099239-original.jpg|200px|link=IT-O (Eyetee-Oh) (Reflections Foil)|alt=IT-O (Eyetee-Oh), Reflections foil, English]] || [[IT-O (Eyetee-Oh) (Reflections Foil)|IT-O (Eyetee-Oh)]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Droid|Droid]] || VR || 2 || When at Detention Block Corridor, adds X to your Force drains there, where X = number of captives present. Immune to Restraining Bolt.
