| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Jabba-PSA-photo-149257422-original.jpg|200px|link=Jabba (Reflections Foil)|alt=Jabba, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Jabba (Reflections Foil)|Jabba]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 1 || To use his landspeed requires +1 Force. Your aliens are deploy -1 to same location. While at Audience Chamber, adds 2 to forfeit of all your non-unique aliens and makes Scum And Villainy immune to Alter. Immune to attrition &lt; 4.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Jabba-s-Sail-Barge-PSA-photo-181170640-original.jpg|200px|link=Jabba's Sail Barge (Reflections Foil)|alt=Jabba's Sail Barge, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Jabba's Sail Barge (Reflections Foil)|Jabba's Sail Barge]] || English || [[Vehicle]] — [[Transport Vehicle|Transport Vehicle]] || VR || 3 || Deploys only on Tatooine; you may immediately deploy Passenger Deck from your Reserve Deck and reshuffle. May add 1 driver and 7 passengers. Your aliens deploy −1 aboard.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Lobot-SWCA-photo-11236-original.jpg|200px|link=Lobot (Dark) (Reflections Foil)|alt=Lobot, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Lobot (Dark) (Reflections Foil)|Lobot]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 1 || Deploys only on Cloud City. Power +2 when present at a Scomp link. If present at a site, can be replaced by opponent with any Light Side Lobot. While present on Cloud City with your Lando, prevents replacement of Lobot and Lando.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Mist-Hunter-PSA-photo-155139316-original.jpg|200px|link=Mist Hunter (Reflections Foil)|alt=Mist Hunter, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Mist Hunter (Reflections Foil)|Mist Hunter]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Starfighter|Starfighter]] || VR || 4 || May add 2 pilots (one must be a smuggler or bounty hunter) and 3 passengers. Immune to attrition &lt; 3 if Zuckuss piloting. Has ship-docking capability.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Obsidian-7-PSA-photo-181170638-original.jpg|200px|link=Obsidian 7 (Reflections Foil)|alt=Obsidian 7, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Obsidian 7 (Reflections Foil)|Obsidian 7]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Starfighter|Starfighter]] || VR || 2 || Deploy -1 and power +3 at any cloud sector. Permanent pilot provides ability of 2.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Obsidian-8-PSA-photo-154591377-original.jpg|200px|link=Obsidian 8 (Reflections Foil)|alt=Obsidian 8, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Obsidian 8 (Reflections Foil)|Obsidian 8]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Starfighter|Starfighter]] || VR || 3 || Deploy -1 and power +3 at any cloud sector. Permanent pilot provides ability of 1.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Presence-Of-The-Force-PSA-photo-140931665-original.jpg|200px|link=Presence Of The Force (Reflections Foil)|alt=Presence Of The Force, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Presence Of The Force (Reflections Foil)|Presence Of The Force]] || English || [[Effect]] || VR || 2 || Deploy on any location to add one [[Dark Force|Dark Side Force]] icon and one [[Light Force|Light Side Force]] icon.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Punishing-One-PSA-photo-155139319-original.jpg|200px|link=Punishing One (Reflections Foil)|alt=Punishing One, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Punishing One (Reflections Foil)|Punishing One]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Starfighter|Starfighter]] || VR || 3 || May add 1 pilot (must be a smuggler or bounty hunter) and 1 passenger. Immune to attrition &lt; 3 if Dengar piloting. Deploy -3 when deploying with Dengar. Boosted TIE Cannon may deploy aboard.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Rancor-PSA-photo-155135610-original.jpg|200px|link=Rancor (Reflections Foil)|alt=Rancor, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Rancor (Reflections Foil)|Rancor]] || English || [[Creature]] — [[Gigantic Predator|Gigantic Predator]] || VR || 1 || <nowiki>*</nowiki> Ferocity = 8 + destiny. Habitat: Rancor Pit and exterior planet sites. Deploys only to Rancor Pit or a site where Malakili is the only character. Moves toward another Rancor whenever possible.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Salacious-Crumb-PSA-photo-137870426-original.jpg|200px|link=Salacious Crumb (Reflections Foil)|alt=Salacious Crumb, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Salacious Crumb (Reflections Foil)|Salacious Crumb]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 3 || Opponent may initiate battle at same site for free. At same or adjacent site, whenever opponent draws a card for battle destiny, if it is: Even, opponent must use 1 Force (if possible); Odd, destiny card is lost. (AH-hahahahaha!)
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Slip-Sliding-Away-PSA-photo-141061821-original.jpg|200px|link=Slip Sliding Away (Reflections Foil)|alt=Slip Sliding Away, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Slip Sliding Away (Reflections Foil)|Slip Sliding Away]] || English || [[Interrupt]] — [[Used Interrupt|Used Interrupt]] || VR || 3 || Relocate a card from the top of any Deck or Pile to the bottom (without looking). OR If you have a droid at a Scomp link on Cloud City, cancel Into The Ventilation Shaft, Lefty. OR Use 3 Force to cause a character at Weather Vane to be lost.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Stalker-PSA-photo-155139300-original.jpg|200px|link=Stalker (Reflections Foil)|alt=Stalker, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Stalker (Reflections Foil)|Stalker]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Capital|Capital]] || VR || 1 || May add 6 pilots, 8 passengers, 2 vehicles and 4 TIEs. Has ship-docking capability. Permanent pilot provides ability of 1. Probe droids deploy free to sites related to same system.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Superlaser-PSA-photo-144332863-original.jpg|200px|link=Superlaser (Reflections Foil)|alt=Superlaser, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Superlaser (Reflections Foil)|Superlaser]] || English || [[Weapon]] — [[Death Star Weapon|Death Star Weapon]] || VR || 3 || Deploy on Death Star system at parsec 0. May target a capital starship at Death Star system, or at a system it orbits, using 4 Force. Draw two destiny. Target hit if total destiny &gt; defense value.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-The-Circle-Is-Now-Complete-PSA-photo-140931629-original.jpg|200px|link=The Circle Is Now Complete (Reflections Foil)|alt=The Circle Is Now Complete, Reflections foil, English]] || [[The Circle Is Now Complete (Reflections Foil)|The Circle Is Now Complete]] || English || [[Interrupt]] — [[Lost Interrupt|Lost Interrupt]] || VR || 6 || If Vader and Obi-Wan are present at same site, use 1 Force to initiate a duel between them. Either Jedi is power +2 if they have a lightsaber. Loser of duel is out of play.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Tonnika-Sisters-PSA-photo-148512011-original.jpg|200px|link=Tonnika Sisters (Reflections Foil)|alt=Tonnika Sisters, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Tonnika Sisters (Reflections Foil)|Tonnika Sisters]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 2 || Twice during each of your control phases, may use 2 Force to draw 2 destiny for 2 chances at a destiny = 2. If successful, may steal or destroy up to 2 weapons or 2 devices present. (Targeted as one character; requires double Force to use landspeed.)
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Tyrant-PSA-photo-155139302-original.jpg|200px|link=Tyrant (Reflections Foil)|alt=Tyrant, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Tyrant (Reflections Foil)|Tyrant]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Capital|Capital]] || VR || 1 || May add 6 pilots, 8 passengers, 2 vehicles and 4 TIEs. Has ship-docking capability. Permanent pilot provides ability of 1. When using a tractor beam, adds 1 to destiny draw.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-U-3PO-Yoo-Threepio-PSA-photo-139298739-original.jpg|200px|link=U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio) (Reflections Foil)|alt=U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio), Reflections foil, English]] || [[U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio) (Reflections Foil)|U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio)]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Droid|Droid]] || VR || 3 || Deploy on opponent’s side as an Undercover spy (except that if present during a battle at a site, adds its power to Light Side). If spy’s “cover is broken,” the above game text is canceled and Light Side may use as if stolen.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Vengeance-PSA-photo-155139301-original.jpg|200px|link=Vengeance (Reflections Foil)|alt=Vengeance, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Vengeance (Reflections Foil)|Vengeance]] || English || [[Starship]] — [[Capital Starship|Capital Starship]] || VR || 2 || May add 6 pilots, 8 passengers, 1 vehicle and 6 TIEs. Has ship-docking capability. Permanent pilot provides ability of 2. Your TIE/lns are forfeit +2 at same location. Power +2 at Nal Hutta.
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Visage-Of-The-Emperor-SWCA-photo-45108-original.jpg|200px|link=Visage Of The Emperor (Reflections Foil)|alt=Visage Of The Emperor, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Visage Of The Emperor (Reflections Foil)|Visage Of The Emperor]] || English || [[Effect]] || VR || 7 || Lose 2 Force to deploy on Executor: Holotheatre or Death Star: Conference Room. At the end of each player’s turn, each player must lose 1 Force. Effect canceled if opponent controls this site. (Immune to Alter.)
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Wampa-PSA-photo-181170634-original.jpg|200px|link=Wampa (Reflections Foil)|alt=Wampa, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Wampa (Reflections Foil)|Wampa]] || English || [[Creature]] — [[Snow Creature|Snow Creature]] || VR || 3 || <nowiki>*</nowiki> Ferocity = 3 + destiny. Habitat: Hoth sites. Deploy only to Wampa Cave or unoccupied marker site. Defeated characters are eaten or relocated to Wampa Cave (opponent of victim chooses).
|-
| [[File:Reflections-Foil-D-Zuckuss-SWCA-photo-45110-original.jpg|200px|link=Zuckuss (Reflections Foil)|alt=Zuckuss, Reflections foil, English]] || [[Zuckuss (Reflections Foil)|Zuckuss]] || English || [[Character]] — [[Alien|Alien]] || VR || 1 || Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. May move for free as a ‘react’. Once during each battle, may use 1 Force to cause one alien of ability &lt; 3 at same site to be forfeit = 0 for remainder of turn. Immune to attrition &lt; 3.
|}
</div>

== Print sheets ==
Foils are 10&times;10 (100 cards). Each side had two foil sheets. Ultra rare foil once on one of the two sheets; super rare foil 2&times; across both; very rare foil 4&times; across both.<ref name="encyc" />

